  "_doc": [
    "Every sponsor once, shared by every board that lists it (board.json \"sponsors\": [\"kia\", ...]).",
    "<id>.png next to this file is the sponsor's finished LED row (2048x128, 16:1) - the image that gets installed.",
    "`install.py rows [id ...]` (re)makes those PNGs from the entries below; an entry with \"manual\": true is a",
    "hand-made PNG and is never overwritten. Fields:",
    "  name        display name",
    "  logo        file in logos/ (.svg .png .jpg .webp)",
    "  stock       instead of a logo: a stock LED texture (resources/LED Boards/lcd/) + row (0 = top)",
    "  background  [r, g, b] row colour (default: the logo's own edge colour when it has one, else white behind a",
    "              dark logo and near-black behind a light one)",
    "  repeat      logo copies across the row (default: as many as fill it, wide logos fewer)",
    "  margin      gap around the logo, fraction of the row height (default 0.12)",
    "  white       true = recolour the logo solid white",
    "  light       true = the logo's dark, colourless parts (black/grey lettering) turn white, coloured parts",
    "              stay - for a dark logo on a dark brand colour",
    "  knockout    [r, g, b] = a card colour behind the logo (e.g. a white tile) made see-through first",
    "  source      where the logo came from"
  ],
